      2026-11-26; Updated by: Statistics Finland'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Tuomisto & Tainio 2005 composite traffic
    authority: Jouni T Tuomisto and Marko Tainio (National Public Health 
      Institute KTL)
    url: https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-2458-5-123
    description: 'BMC Public Health 2005, 5:123. Decision analysis of composite traffic,
      a demand-responsive public transport system pooling car trips into 8- and 4-seat
      vehicles, in the Helsinki metropolitan area. Table 1: pressures and costs at
      0/25/50/75/100 % composite fraction. Table 2: input distributions.; Attachment:
      source_material/1471-2458-5-123.pdf; Format: Journal article; Licensing: CC
      BY 2.0; Geographic Coverage: Helsinki metropolitan area; Date Last Updated:
      2005-11-25; Updated by: BioMed Central'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Väylävirasto 81/2024 appraisal unit values
    authority: Finnish Transport Infrastructure Agency (Väylävirasto)
    url: https://www.doria.fi/handle/10024/190638
    description: 'Tie- ja rautatieliikenteen hankearvioinnin yksikköarvojen määrittäminen
      vuodelle 2022 (Väyläviraston julkaisuja 81/2024). Values of time (Tables 24-25),
      employer charges 21.5 %, accident unit costs (Table 36), CO2 shadow price (Table
      1). 2022 prices.; Attachment: source_material/current_2025/vaylavirasto_81_2024_hankearvioinnin_yksikkoarvot_2022.pdf;
      Format: PDF report; Geographic Coverage: Finland; Date Last Updated: 2024-12-01;
      Updated by: Väylävirasto'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: Waymo remote assistance 2026
    authority: Futurism
    url: https://futurism.com/advanced-transport/waymo-remote-operators
    description: "Waymo's letter to Senator Markey (Feb 2026): about 70 remote assistance
      agents on duty worldwide at any time, for a fleet of about 3,000 vehicles. A
      company statement, as reported.; Attachment: source_material/driverless/waymo_remote_operators_2026.html;
      Format: News article; Geographic Coverage: United States; Date Last Updated:
      2026-02-01; Updated by: Futurism"
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: YTV travel survey 2000
    authority: Raimo Valtanen, YTV, in Helsingin seudun suunnat 1/2003
    url: 
      https://www.hel.fi/hel2/tietokeskus/suunnat/artikkelit/artikkeli103.html
    description: 'Liikkumistottumukset pääkaupunkiseudulla: residents made 3.1 million
      trips on an autumn weekday in 2000, 44 % by car.; Attachment: source_material/current_2025/ytv_liikkumistottumukset_2000_suunnat_1_2003.html;
      Format: Web article; Geographic Coverage: Helsinki metropolitan area; Date Last
      Updated: 2003-03-01; Updated by: City of Helsinki'
